# ==============================================================================
# CURSOR SYSTEM RULE: WP PLUGIN VERSION (EXPLICIT RELEASE ONLY)
# ==============================================================================

# Target File: omi-seo-ai-bridge.php (main plugin header)

Do not auto-increment version on ordinary edits.

Plugin distribution is GitHub Releases only:
- Tag: vx.y.z
- Asset: wp-seo-ai-x.y.z.zip (folder `wp-seo-ai/` at ZIP root). Legacy `omi-seo-ai-bridge-x.y.z.zip` still accepted.
- Laravel observes/triggers updates; it does not host ZIP packages.

There is no compress_plugin.ps1 and no Laravel Update Server.
